host_key_changed.body:
The SSH host key of the server {{target_name}} is no longer the one you confirmed.

Confirmed fingerprint: {{old_fingerprint}}
Fingerprint the server shows now: {{new_fingerprint}}

Alice stopped all work on this server. If the server was reinstalled or its keys were replaced on purpose, an administrator can review the new fingerprint on the server's page in Alice and accept it. If nobody changed the server, treat this as a possible attack and contact your security team.
